    excerpt: "Google Ads is the most powerful intent-based advertising platform on earth. Here's how to set it up correctly and make it profitable from day one.",
    category: "Digital Marketing",
    tags: ["Google Ads", "PPC", "Search Advertising", "Quality Score", "Ad Campaign", "Pay-Per-Click", "Keywords"],
    readTime: 10,
