    metaDescription: "Build a social media marketing strategy that generates real business results in 2025. Covers platform selection, content strategy, organic growth, and social media ROI measurement.",
    ogTitle: "Social Media Marketing Strategy That Drives Revenue in 2025",
    ogDescription: "A practical social media strategy framework that delivers leads, builds authority, and drives revenue — not just likes and follows.",
    excerpt: "Posting content without a strategy is just noise. Here's how to build a social media presence that systematically converts followers into clients.",
    category: "Social Media",
    tags: ["Social Media Marketing", "Content Strategy", "Instagram", "LinkedIn", "TikTok", "Brand Growth", "Social Media ROI"],
